{"v":4,"catch":"當你瀕臨死亡時，那就是你繼續射擊的時候！","desc":"《GUNNAIL》是NMK於1993年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n這個遊戲有一個叫做 MULTIPLE SHIELD SYSTEM 的功能，你擁有的盾牌越少，得分越高。\n體驗 NMK 典型的硬核遊戲機制和激烈的評分系統！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-01-13","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e48ec786f3e6578e7d5d5669e46452fcf7b464ffb20fde4e4493816435f55bce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/74ccaf2b6e6f181d4b767cb188e865fdc0722e3561a3d54d6b6b8761488ab5da.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae038a1cb2fa54a8994bf6e4c265230f4a65ac37268ded50a64d028e6237b3d1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/daf9d6a6a56d265266c18e2f471c1c64529b31d1c323b06a879095e50ad20707.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9401a2a91f901f4423427ab716cdc2f2b208aeddd99ef582a277b61403dd5aae.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6635c2bbfbf001d8febdc503dfc85d93d689d8655e9b6501589813e0b598483a.jpg"],"titleId":"01001f4016ac8000","dlc":[]}